    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>A grooming salon located right in the centre of Cavalaire-sur-Mer since 1994, handy for a freshen-up before or after a day at the beach. The salon offers full grooming as well as a selection of accessories for dogs and cats, with good consistent reviews on two platforms (about 4.7/5), citing the welcome, the attentiveness and prices considered reasonable.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The salon is closed on weekends — plan your slot during the week, especially during the summer season when appointments go fast. A simple phone call is enough to book.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: if you're planning to combine beach and grooming, allow plenty of time in summer — the salon closes for a midday break like many businesses in the area.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Cavalaire town centre, its shops and its market are just a stone's throw away, so you can get two things done while your dog gets pampered.</p>
